---
layout: base
permalink: /index.html
title: 'Hylia''s Corner'
description: 'Hylia here (real name: Levi I.), a current compsci major sophomore looking to leave something behind. This is both my personal blog, Hylia''s Corner, and my portfolio for graphic design, coding projects, and (soon-to-be) games or other creative projects.'
blog:
  title: 'Hylia''s Corner (my blog)'
  intro: {{ meta.siteDescription }}
---

<div class="wrapper">
  <header class="full | section spot-color-theme-primary">
    <div class="section__inner flow region">
      <h1 class="text-center text-theme-light">{{ title }}</h1>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/waves", null, "divider" %}
  </header>

  <article class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow prose">
      <p>
        <strong>Hylia</strong> here (real name: Levi I.), a current compsci major looking to leave something behind. This is both my <a href="blog">personal blog, Hylia's Corner,</a> and <a href="portfolio">my creative portfolio</a> for graphic design, coding projects, games, and anything else I'm inspired to make. 
      </p>
      <p>Explore the site to your heart's content, though things are still moving around. I'll update this once things are tidier, but for now, have a good one and write something today.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow prose">
      <h2><a href="blog">{{ meta.blog.name }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ meta.blog.description }}</p>
      <div class="feature |  region region-space-l">
        <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
          {% set itemList = collections.allPosts %}
					{% asyncEach item in itemList.slice(0, 4) %}
            {% set headingLevel = "h3" %}
						{% include "partials/card-blog.njk" %}
					{% endeach %}
        </custom-masonry>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
